  (text "5V INPUT (USB-C or 2-pin header, 5V / 2A)"
    (at 22 35 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6ea3249e-e7bb-5cfa-ad8a-8299d0ef1e9f)
  )
  (text "R1/R2: USB-C sink Rd. F1 resettable fuse. Total load about 1 A at 5 V with backlight at 180 mA."
    (at 22 114 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 6c06e0b8-c4a4-5f40-8723-b6d5c8ba7ae4)
  )
  (text "3.3 V BUCK  Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 453k/100k) = 3.32 V"
    (at 22 129 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 801e9de6-fd67-531d-8dff-a81d3843c163)
  )
  (text "1.8 V BUCK  Vout = 0.6 V x (1 + 200k/100k) = 1.80 V"
    (at 22 185 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 28195e05-172a-5a54-a5a6-383174eff581)
  )
  (text "ANALOG RAILS (ADC / PLL supply filters)"
    (at 22 241 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d22cd672-6cd3-5f84-b8ee-779a9a55c404)
  )
  (text "LED BACKLIGHT DRIVER (constant current boost, 5 V in, up to 38 V out)"
    (at 202 35 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 42412d96-244a-586b-b900-1e958cd56516)
  )
  (text "I_LED(max) = 0.214 V / Rset.  R7 only: 42 mA (JP4 open, default).  JP4 closed (R7 || R8 = 1.63R): 131 mA."
    (at 202 126 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e83e41b7-dbf0-5445-ac11-f5ef5d7f983b)
  )
  (text "Typical 7\" 1024x600 50-pin panels: 9.6 V, 120-140 mA (3 LEDs in series x 6-7 strings). Check your panel, then close JP4."
    (at 202 130 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3295b862-7805-5d97-8d8b-a5d206885aeb)
  )
  (text "BL_EN_N (RTD pin 111) low = on: Q3 releases CTRL.  R9 keeps the backlight off while the RTD2660 is in reset."
    (at 202 134 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid cf2b1ce6-7096-5cd1-96f4-fb9b68b32294)
  )
  (text "Dimming: PWM0 (RTD pin 102) is filtered by R46/C14 and summed into FB by R47: higher duty = dimmer, 100 % = off."
    (at 202 138 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid da71fadb-c1c1-57e5-bb20-715636d19e12)
  )
  (text "For direct PWM on CTRL (5-100 kHz) remove R10 and R47 and fit R11.  Open-LED clamp is 38 V: C11, D1 rated >= 40 V."
    (at 202 142 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a49459a5-ce05-50e5-bf2f-1ec805ee421d)
  )
  (text "MOUNTING HOLES"
    (at 202 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid a1cd8754-4548-530f-a142-81d9651cbe23)
  )
